### Describe the bug

I connected a scraping agent (using an API request to the tool) to an LLM to view the output. The scraping tool requires specific params, which includes the user's API key. I added that API key in the variables section and reading it from there. This API key shows in the scraping API Input response section, which exposes user's API. 

### To Reproduce

- Go to Variables > Add Variable > Fill in the details (Type= Static) and paste the API key you want to read from the variables. 
- Save.
- Go to Agentflows
- Add New
- Click the + icon and add HTTP
- Fill the API request detail and include the API key from the variable (`vars.api_source...`).
- Run the agent and view its details.

### Expected behavior

Any API key added as a Variables should be encrypted and not plain original API key shouldn't shown in the response params.

